H('3.4 Alternative Solutions and Evaluation',2)
P('Alternative 1: build a lightweight parser and rewrite engine, gaining control but taking on dialect and correctness burden. Alternative 2: adapt an existing relational planning library, reducing parser effort while adding integration risk. Alternative 3: orchestrate native EXPLAIN with manually authored SQL candidates, which is quick but offers little compiler functionality.')
