center('SQL -> Parse and analyze -> Logical plan -> Guarded rewrites',10,True);center('-> Equivalence validation -> DBMS EXPLAIN -> Benchmark -> Recommendation',10,True)
P('For n repetitions, report the median ordered observation (or mean of the two middle values) and P95 using a declared convention. Relative change = (baseline median - candidate median) / baseline median x 100%. A positive value indicates lower observed latency for this test only. The parser emits a typed representation; rewrite rules return candidates with provenance; the DBMS adapter executes validated read-only SQL; the benchmark records environment and raw observations.')
